# Build context is the repo root for every image; keep it small.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/coverage
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
.git
.github
docs
scripts
**/*.md
# …except the AR characters' knowledge sheets, which the API reads (FUENTES.md stays out).
!data/ra/*/es.md
!data/ra/*/en.md
!data/ra/*/pt.md
